  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "the next round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if int(round / 2) * 2 != round else 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "stone_offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[k for k in [1, 2, 3, 4, 5] if stone_owner[k - 1] == '' and len(([stone_1_a, stone_2_a, stone_3_a, stone_4_a, stone_5_a] if you.role == 'A' else [stone_1_b, stone_2_b, stone_3_b, stone_4_b, stone_5_b])[k - 1]) < side_capacity]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round} of at most {max_rounds}: seat {active_seat} acts."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "the board",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Stone 1: A {stone_1_a} | B {stone_1_b}. Stone 2: A {stone_2_a} | B {stone_2_b}. Stone 3: A {stone_3_a} | B {stone_3_b}. Stone 4: A {stone_4_a} | B {stone_4_b}. Stone 5: A {stone_5_a} | B {stone_5_b}. Owners (Stones 1-5): {stone_owner}. First finishers: {first_finisher}. Claimed: seat 1 (A) {players[0].claimed}, seat 2 (B) {players[1].claimed}. Draw pile: {deck_count} cards."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "your hand",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "role",
        "claimed"
      ],
      "text": "Your hand:"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "choose a card",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "hand"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "card"
      },
      "text": "Choose one card from your hand to play face up on your side of a Stone."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "choose a stone",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "stone_offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "stone"
      },
      "text": "Choose the Stone to play your card on. Only unclaimed Stones where your side holds fewer than {side_capacity} cards are offered."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "place the card",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "chosen_card",
            "value": "$card"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "chosen_stone",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int($stone)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_1_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 1 and active_seat == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_1_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 1 and active_seat == 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_2_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 2 and active_seat == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_2_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 2 and active_seat == 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_3_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 3 and active_seat == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_3_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 3 and active_seat == 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_4_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 4 and active_seat == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_4_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 4 and active_seat == 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_5_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 5 and active_seat == 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "stone_5_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_stone == 5 and active_seat == 2"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {active_seat} plays {chosen_card} on Stone {chosen_stone}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "first finisher",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "first_finisher",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[(('A' if active_seat == 1 else 'B') if (k == chosen_stone and len(([stone_1_a, stone_2_a, stone_3_a, stone_4_a, stone_5_a] if active_seat == 1 else [stone_1_b, stone_2_b, stone_3_b, stone_4_b, stone_5_b])[k - 1]) == side_capacity and len(([stone_1_b, stone_2_b, stone_3_b, stone_4_b, stone_5_b] if active_seat == 1 else [stone_1_a, stone_2_a, stone_3_a, stone_4_a, stone_5_a])[k - 1]) < side_capacity) else first_finisher[k - 1]) for k in [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "draw a card",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "deck_count > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "active_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "deck_count > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "deck_count > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "deck_count",
            "value": -1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "deck_count > 0"
            },
            "text": "Seat {active_seat} draws a card. {deck_count} cards remain in the draw pile."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "resolve stones",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "str_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[((sum([int(c[1]) for c in s]) + (straight_flush_bonus if (s[0][0] == s[1][0] and s[1][0] == s[2][0] and s[0][1] != s[1][1] and s[1][1] != s[2][1] and s[0][1] != s[2][1] and max([int(c[1]) for c in s]) - min([int(c[1]) for c in s]) == straight_span) else (three_of_a_kind_bonus if (s[0][1] == s[1][1] and s[1][1] == s[2][1]) else (flush_bonus if (s[0][0] == s[1][0] and s[1][0] == s[2][0]) else (straight_bonus if (s[0][1] != s[1][1] and s[1][1] != s[2][1] and s[0][1] != s[2][1] and max([int(c[1]) for c in s]) - min([int(c[1]) for c in s]) == straight_span) else no_formation_bonus))))) if len(s) == side_capacity else 0) for s in [stone_1_a, stone_2_a, stone_3_a, stone_4_a, stone_5_a]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "str_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[((sum([int(c[1]) for c in s]) + (straight_flush_bonus if (s[0][0] == s[1][0] and s[1][0] == s[2][0] and s[0][1] != s[1][1] and s[1][1] != s[2][1] and s[0][1] != s[2][1] and max([int(c[1]) for c in s]) - min([int(c[1]) for c in s]) == straight_span) else (three_of_a_kind_bonus if (s[0][1] == s[1][1] and s[1][1] == s[2][1]) else (flush_bonus if (s[0][0] == s[1][0] and s[1][0] == s[2][0]) else (straight_bonus if (s[0][1] != s[1][1] and s[1][1] != s[2][1] and s[0][1] != s[2][1] and max([int(c[1]) for c in s]) - min([int(c[1]) for c in s]) == straight_span) else no_formation_bonus))))) if len(s) == side_capacity else 0) for s in [stone_1_b, stone_2_b, stone_3_b, stone_4_b, stone_5_b]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "new_owner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[(stone_owner[i] if stone_owner[i] != '' else (('A' if str_a[i] > str_b[i] else ('B' if str_b[i] > str_a[i] else first_finisher[i])) if (len([stone_1_a, stone_2_a, stone_3_a, stone_4_a, stone_5_a][i]) == side_capacity and len([stone_1_b, stone_2_b, stone_3_b, stone_4_b, stone_5_b][i]) == side_capacity) else '')) for i in [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "claimed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(o == you.role for o in new_owner)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stone_owner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "new_owner"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "new_owner != stone_owner"
            },
            "text": "A Stone is resolved. Strengths on A's sides {str_a}, on B's sides {str_b}. Owners (Stones 1-5): {stone_owner}. Claimed: seat 1 (A) {players[0].claimed}, seat 2 (B) {players[1].claimed}."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "is it over",
      "when": {
        "calc": "max([p.claimed for p in players]) >= stones_to_win or round >= max_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "max([p.claimed for p in players]) >= stones_to_win or round >= max_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.claimed",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Stones claimed: seat 1 (A) {players[0].claimed}, seat 2 (B) {players[1].claimed}; owners of Stones 1-5: {stone_owner}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 30,
    "rounds_max": 30,
    "actions_max": 500,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "COMPONENTS: A deck of {deck_size} cards, {colours} colours (Red, Blue, Green, Yellow) x values 1-{max_card_value}, each card written like 'R7'. There are {stones} Stones numbered 1-5. Each Stone has a side for Player A and a side for Player B, and each side holds at most {side_capacity} cards.\n\nSETUP: The deck is shuffled. Each player is dealt {hand_size} cards face down. Each hand is private: only its owner sees it. The remaining {draw_pile_after_deal} cards form a face-down draw pile. Seat 1 is Player A and seat 2 is Player B; A takes the first turn.\n\nROUNDS: The game has at most {max_rounds} rounds. In odd rounds Player A is active; in even rounds Player B is active. Each round: (1) Both players are told the cards on every side of every Stone, which Stones are claimed and by whom, each player's number of claimed Stones, and how many cards remain in the draw pile. (2) The active player chooses one card from their hand. (3) The active player chooses one Stone that is unclaimed and whose side for that player holds fewer than {side_capacity} cards; only such Stones are offered. A player always has such a Stone and a card to play, and must play. (4) The card moves from the hand to that player's side of the chosen Stone, face up. Cards never move again. (5) If this card was the third card on that side and the other side has fewer than {side_capacity} cards, this player is recorded as that Stone's 'first finisher'; otherwise nothing is recorded. (6) If the draw pile is not empty, the active player draws its top card into their hand; if it is empty, no card is drawn. (7) Every unclaimed Stone where both sides now hold {side_capacity} cards is resolved. (8) If either player has claimed {stones_to_win} Stones, the game ends immediately and that player wins; otherwise play continues.\n\nSTRENGTH OF A SIDE: Let the three values sum to S. The side has one formation: Straight Flush (all three cards share a colour, the values are all different, and highest minus lowest equals {straight_span}): bonus {straight_flush_bonus}. Three of a Kind (all three values equal): bonus {three_of_a_kind_bonus}. Flush (all three cards share a colour, not a Straight Flush): bonus {flush_bonus}. Straight (values all different, highest minus lowest equals {straight_span}, not a Straight Flush): bonus {straight_bonus}. Otherwise: bonus {no_formation_bonus}. Strength = S + bonus. Examples: R3 R4 R5 = 132, R7 B7 G7 = 111, B1 B5 B9 = 75, R6 B7 G8 = 51, R2 B5 G9 = 16.\n\nRESOLVING A STONE: The side with the higher strength claims the Stone and that player's claimed count goes up by 1. If the strengths are equal, the first finisher of that Stone claims it. A claimed Stone stays on the table with its cards visible, but it can no longer be played on.\n\nEND: The first player to claim {stones_to_win} of the {stones} Stones wins immediately. If the game reaches the end of round {max_rounds} without this, the player with more claimed Stones wins; equal counts are a draw (a shared win)."
}
